  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nNow, if ‘×’ = ‘-’, ‘-’ = ‘+’, ‘/’ = ‘×’ and ‘+’ = ‘÷’, then:\n\nOption (1) 12 × 4 - 2 + 8 / 4 = 11\n\n⇒ 12 - 4 + 2 ÷ 8 × 4 = ?\n\n⇒ 12 - 4 + (2 ÷ 8 × 4) = ?\n\n⇒ 12 - 4 + (0.25 × 4) = ?\n\n⇒ 12 - 4 + 1 = ?\n\n⇒ 8 + 1 = 9 ≠ 11\n\nOption (2) 18 - 6 × 3 + 2 / 2 = 13\n\n⇒ 18 + 6 - 3 ÷ 2 × 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 18 + 6 - (3 ÷ 2 × 2) = ?\n\n⇒ 18 + 6 - (1.5 × 2) = ?\n\n⇒ 24 - 3 = 21 ≠ 13\n\nOption (3) 14 + 7 - 3 / 2 × 1 = 16\n\n⇒ 14 ÷ 7 + 3 × 2 - 1 = ?\n\n⇒ 2 + 3 × 2 - 1 = ?\n\n⇒ 2 + 6 - 1 = ?\n\n⇒ 8 - 1 = 7 ≠ 16\n\n**Option (4) 20 - 4 + 8 / 2 × 1 = 20**\n\n⇒ 20 + 4 ÷ 8 × 2 - 1 = ?\n\n⇒ 20 + (4 ÷ 8 × 2) - 1 = ?\n\n⇒ 20 + (0.5 × 2) - 1 = ?\n\n⇒ 20 + 1 - 1 = 20\n\n⇒ 20 = 20\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\".**",
